{
  "records": [
    {
      "id": "M001",
      "text": "The CI signing failure E_SIG_47 is fixed by refreshing the cosign OIDC token, not by rotating repository secrets.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-02T09:00:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s01",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M002",
      "text": "The generated API client lives at internal/gen/payments_client.go and must not be edited by hand.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-02T09:05:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s01",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M003",
      "text": "The payment proto source is api/payments/v2/payments.proto.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-02T09:06:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s01",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M004",
      "text": "Run 'buf generate' from the repository root to regenerate payment protobuf code.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-02T09:07:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s01",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": "success"
    },
    {
      "id": "M005",
      "text": "The staging Redis database number is 6.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-03T10:00:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s02",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M006",
      "text": "The cache invalidator must release cacheMu before calling broadcastInvalidation because the callback can synchronously re-enter the cache.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:00:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s03",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M007",
      "text": "When the indexer appears hung with low CPU, inspect the bounded work queue first; producers can block while waiting for a full queue to drain.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:10:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s03",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M008",
      "text": "A zero-length Matrix event body is valid for redactions; validation should inspect the event type before rejecting an empty body.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:20:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s03",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M009",
      "text": "The macOS bridge host speaks newline-delimited JSON over stdin/stdout; stdout must contain protocol frames only.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-06T08:00:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s04",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M010",
      "text": "Diagnostic logging for the bridge host belongs on stderr so it cannot corrupt NDJSON framing.",
      "timestamp": "2026-01-06T08:02:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s04",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
      "id": "M011",
      "text": "The build coordinator is strix03.",
      "timestamp": "2026-02-01T09:00:00+00:00",
      "session_id": "s05",
      "scope": "repo:demo",
      "metadata": {},
      "supersedes_id": null,
      "outcome": null
    },
    {
